From: BioSync Backend <biosync@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add DNA to Protein Translation Engine for 3D Protein Viewer

This patch implements the DNA to Protein Translation Engine for BioSync's
3D Protein Viewer feature. It includes:

- Translation service with molecular weight calculation
- POST /api/protein/translate endpoint
- Pydantic request/response schemas
- Graceful handling of leftover bases (non-multiple of 3)

Files changed:
- app/core/translation.py: Added molecular weight calculation and translate_dna_to_protein()
- app/models/schemas.py: Added ProteinTranslateRequest and ProteinTranslateResponse
- app/api/routers/protein.py: New file - protein translation router
- app/__init__.py: Registered protein router

---
